'''Shields''' are an [[item class]] of armour [[equipment]]. They can contain up to 3 [[socket]]s and need to be equipped in the [[off-hand]] slot. All shields provide a chance to [[block]] attacks, and some also grant [[implicit]] modifiers. Like [[Body Armour]], shields have an inherent 3% [[movement speed]] penalty.

==Mechanics==
*When used for attacks such as with {{il|Spectral Shield Throw}}, attack bonuses that only apply to the off hand will affect it, but not main hand bonuses.
*Characters can only hold one shield at a time.
*Characters can change shields with a [[weapon swap]] keybind.

==Types of shields==
There are 6 sub-types of shields: 
* 3 '''pure''' sub-types which have a single [[attribute]] requirement and provide an associated defense type. 
* 3 '''hybrid''' sub-types which have two attribute requirements and provide both of the associated defense types, although at a lower value than the ''pure'' counterpart.

