== Passive Skills ==
There are [[passive skill]]s that grant bonuses related to shields. 

===Block chance===
{{Query base passive skills
|where=passive_skill_stats.id IN ("dual_wield_or_shield_block_%", "shield_block_%")
}}

===Spell block chance===
{{Query base passive skills
|where=passive_skill_stats.id = "shield_spell_block_%"
}}

===Increases defenses from shield===
{{Query base passive skills
|where=passive_skill_stats.id IN ("shield_armour_+%", "shield_maximum_energy_shield_+%")
}}

===Elemental resistances while holding shield===
{{Query base passive skills
|where=passive_skill_stats.id = "resist_all_elements_+%_while_holding_shield"
}}

===Damage while holding shield===
{{Query base passive skills
|where=passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%damage%shield%"
}}

===Attack speed while holding shield===
{{Query base passive skills
|where=passive_skill_stats.id = "attack_speed_+%_while_holding_shield"
}}

===Other===
{{Query base passive skills
|where=
  passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%shield%"
  AND passive_skill_stats.id NOT LIKE "%energy_shield%"
  AND passive_skill_stats.id NOT LIKE "%damage%shield%"
  AND passive_skill_stats.id NOT IN ("dual_wield_or_shield_block_%", "shield_block_%", "shield_spell_block_%", "shield_armour_+%", "shield_maximum_energy_shield_+%", "resist_all_elements_+%_while_holding_shield", "attack_speed_+%_while_holding_shield")
AND passive_skill_stats.id NOT LIKE "%brequel%"
}}

===Ascendancy passives===
{{Query ascendancy passive skills
|where=
  passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%shield%"
  AND passive_skill_stats.id NOT LIKE "%energy_shield%"
}}
===Keystones===
{{Query keystone passive skills
|where=
  passive_skills.stat_text LIKE "%shield%"
  AND passive_skills.stat_text NOT LIKE "%energy shield%"
}}

